      "Transcript": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "A transcript. The adapter sets `timing` from what the provider actually returned; the pipeline recomputes it\non the turns with `timing_level`.\n\nA provider answer has no ids, speakers or source. In a pipeline result the segments are the turns: every segment\nhas an id (\"t1\", \"t2\"... in order) and a speaker from `speakers`, and a word is addressed as (segment id, word\nindex). Speaker ids are unique, at most one speaker has each role, and segment ids are unique.\n\nAt every timing level: non-blank text is in segments, every segment with text has words, and the words spell the\nsegment's text (letters and digits, lower-cased). A segment or a word has start and end, or neither: times are\nnever estimated or copied. A timed word lies within its timed segment, up to 0.5 seconds outside it.\n\n`timing` is the level the transcript can be relied on for. `segment`: at least 90% of the segments with text have\na start and end. `word`: that too, and at least 90% of the segments with text have times on all their words.\n`none` is text only (or too few times to use). A consumer that needs a time for a word uses the word's time, else\nits segment's time, else there is none (no playback).\n\n`text`: in a pipeline result, the turn texts joined with one space, with no turn or speaker structure; read\n`segments` for that. `duration_seconds`: in a pipeline result, where the audio ends on the file's timeline\n(`source.start_offset_seconds` plus the decoded length), not the container's duration; the audio's own length is\nthe difference, and the billed length is in the usage. In a provider answer it is the upload's length.",
        "properties": {
          "text": {
            "title": "Text",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "language": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "default": null,
            "title": "Language"
          },
          "duration_seconds": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "minimum": 0,
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "default": null,
            "title": "Duration Seconds"
          },
          "timing": {
            "enum": [
              "word",
              "segment",
              "none"
            ],
            "title": "Timing",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "segments": {
            "default": [],
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Segment"
            },
            "title": "Segments",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "source": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Source"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "default": null
          },
          "speakers": {
            "default": [],
